Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Traffic Not Going Through Egress Gateway
If traffic is not routing through the egress gateway:

# Check if egress gateway pods are running
oc get pods -n istio-system -l istio=egressgateway

# Verify gateway configuration
oc describe gateway istio-egressgateway -n egress-lab

# Check VirtualService configuration
oc describe virtualservice -n egress-lab
Issue 2: External Service Not Accessible
If external services are not accessible:

# Check ServiceEntry configuration
oc describe serviceentry httpbin-ext -n egress-lab

# Verify DNS resolution from pod
oc exec -n egress-lab $POD_NAME -- nslookup httpbin.org

# Check sidecar proxy configuration
oc exec -n egress-lab $POD_NAME -c istio-proxy -- pilot-agent request GET config_dump | grep httpbin
Issue 3: Rate Limiting Not Working
If rate limiting is not functioning:

# Check EnvoyFilter configuration
oc describe envoyfilter httpbin-ratelimit -n egress-lab

# Verify Envoy configuration in sidecar
oc exec -n egress-lab $POD_NAME -c istio-proxy -- pilot-agent request GET config_dump | grep -A 20 local_ratelimit
